OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's Welsh family
OL,4,Aconnection revisited after country
OL,5,Asinger's death
OL,6,
OL,7,FDolly Parton's death has brought
OL,8,Frenewed attention in Wales to the
OL,9,Fcountry music legend's Welsh links.
OL,11,FParton's mother's side of the family
OL,12,Fwas believed to have come from Conwy,
OL,13,Fwith her Welsh heritage explored in a
OL,14,F2025 documentary.
OL,16,FTributes to her have also poured in
OL,17,Ffrom people across Wales who had
OL,18,Fpersonal connections to the singer and
OL,19,Fher music.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,436,430,260,140,0,100
