OL,3,GNEWSADolly Parton's Welsh family
OL,4,Aconnection revisited after country
OL,5,Asinger's death
OL,6,
OL,7,FAnd Wales' own music legend Tom Jones
OL,8,Fsaid Parton's death aged 80 following a
OL,9,Fbrief battle with cancer had left "a
OL,10,Fgreat emptiness".
